sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTP API
    participant S as SQLite document store
    participant I as Index manager
    participant W as Snapshot writer

    C->>H: PUT /v1/indexes/{index}/documents/{id}
    H->>H: Validate path, content type, body, and fields
    H->>S: Transactional source upsert + pending job
    S-->>H: New document version + job ID
    H-->>C: 202 version + job ID
    Note over C,W: The bounded worker continues after the response.
    W->>S: Claim job and increment attempt
    W->>I: Tokenize and update postings
    I->>W: Write generation staging file
    W->>W: Rename generation, then manifest
    W->>S: Mark job completed
